#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks could not create the mu-plugins folder. Please create the "
"following directory: %s"
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks no pudo crear el directorio mu-plugins. Crea el siguiente "
"directorio: %s"

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks could not copy the autoloader from %1$s to %2$s. Please copy the "
"file manually."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks no pudo copiar el cargador automático de %1$s a %2$s. Copia el "
"archivo de manera manual."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks will not work with your version of PHP. Pressbooks requires PHP "
"version %s or greater. Please upgrade PHP if you would like to use "
"Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"PressBooks no funciona con esta versión de PHP. PressBooks requiere la "
"versión %s o superior de PHP. Actualice la instalación si desea utilizar "
"PressBooks."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pressbooks will not work with your version of WordPress. Pressbooks requires "
"a dedicated install of WordPress Multisite, version %s or greater. Please "
"upgrade WordPress if you would like to use Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"PressBooks no funciona con esta versión de WordPress. PressBooks requiere "
"una instalación nueva de WordPress Multi-sitio, versión %s o más reciente. "
"Por favor, para utilizar PressBooks actualice WordPress."

msgid ""
"The Pressbooks plugin is inactive, but you have active plugins that require "
"Pressbooks. This is causing errors. Please go to the Plugins page, and "
"activate Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"El plugin Pressbooks está inactivo, pero tiene plugins activos que requieren "
"Pressbooks. Esto está causando errores. Por favor, vaya a la página de "
"plugins y active Pressbooks."

